1. refer to ref.py to write a dns bind zone and view file parser
2. input is a dns bind zone file and a dns bind view file
3. output is a csv file with columns: zone, view, name, type, ttl, data per view.zone
4. use typer as cli framework
5. write tests coverage more than 70%
6. use loguru for logging
8. use tqdm for progress bar
9. use pytest for testing
10. use example view file and zone file in tests folder
11. update readme.md eventually